%U A401171 34432,65536,128768,130304,131072,262144,437745,442365,449295,522752,524288,1048576
%N A401171 Nonprime numbers k, such that 2*u*k + 2 = u*sigma(k) + tau(k), where u is an integer.
%C A401171 Nonprime numbers k, such that abs(A398982(n)) = 1, equivalently numbers k, such that abs(A398982(n)) = 1 and A398981(n) != 0.
%C A401171 Also f-perfect numbers, where f(n) = u*n+1, where u is a nonzero integer.
%H A401171 Žiga Pirc, <a href="/A401171/b401171.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..60</a>
%e A401171 10 is here since 2*1*10 + 2 = 22, 1*sigma(10) + tau(10) = 18 + 4 = 22.
%o A401171 (PARI) is_A401171(n) = !isprime(n) && abs((2*n-sigma(n))/gcd(numdiv(n)-2, 2*n-sigma(n))) == 1
%Y A401171 Contains: A000079 (except 2 since it's prime), A066229, A066230.
%Y A401171 Cf. A398982, A000203, A000005.
